 "background": "A rare historical ballad. An envoy arrives in Ohrid from Constantinople and summons Patriarch Arsenij, so that the Ohrid Archbishopric can be abolished. The aged patriarch gives his flock a farewell and a warning. The song gives the year as 1762; Qwen notes that historians date the abolition of the Ohrid Archbishopric to 1767.",
 "background_source": "Source of these notes: Qwen's draft.",
 "english_kind": "pesna",
 "en_note": "From Pesna.org (translation: Pesna.org)*\n",
 "translator_notes": "",
